+    fix: 'Apply the recipe by hand; commit with "Recipe: <path>" and "Scaffolded-by: hand (no LLM key)"; run the ledger — the row is identical to aider''s'
+    verified: 17 commits with the trailer; ledger aider column "no" on all 27 rows (2026-10-05 → 2026-10-16)
+  - id: U02
